        "text": "theorem cross_reconstruct (H : Mat2) (T R : Vec2)\n    (hcone : SmoothCovariance.StrictCone H T) :\n    H.mulVec (fun j => 2 * SmoothCovariance.amplitudes H T j * increment H T R j) = R"
